a tire on his Bugatti.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":8},{"lap":6,"text":"Bordino retakes the lead from Ascari.","q":false,"c":15},{"lap":7,"text":"Third place went back and forth between Guinness and Campari while Wagner, Divo and Resta were fighting for fifth, sixth and seventh places.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":12},{"lap":8,"text":"Segrave stopped to change plugs again and dropped further behind.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":4},{"lap":8,"text":"In the meantime, the Bugattis of Fridrich and de Vizcaya stopped to have the tires changed. The team realized that the treads would not stay on their special tires","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":7},{"lap":9,"text":"On lap nine, Nazzaro stopped at the pits to change spark plugs.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":11},{"lap":10,"text":"Bordino's average lap time during the last five laps was 11m30s.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":15},{"lap":12,"text":"On the 12th lap, when Bordino experienced fading brakes, Ascari grabbed the lead while Bordino stopped at the pits, working for more than half an hour on the Fiat's front brakes.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":8},{"lap":12,"text":"Pastore who had held tenth place retired the Fiat, including de Vizcaya's Bugatti, who crashed off the road, badly damaging the front of the car.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":18},{"lap":16,"text":"Guinness led the 16th lap ahead of Campari","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":12},{"lap":17,"text":"Ascari loses over a minute refuelling and changing rear wheels.","q":false,"c":8},{"lap":17,"text":"Zborowski retired the Miller after the front axle loosened from the frame, caused by the rough road sections.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":16},{"lap":17,"text":"Campari led the 17th lap ahead of Guinness, Divo, Ascari, Benoist and Wagner.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":18,"text":"Bordino, who had fallen over one hour behind the leader, retired on lap 18.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":15},{"lap":19,"text":"When Campari stopped on lap 19, Ascari took the lead with Guinness third and Divo fourth. Goux retired on lap 19 with a damaged radiator.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":8},{"lap":21,"text":"Guinness retires after Givors with a broken transmission.","q":false,"c":12},{"lap":22,"text":"On lap 22, Segrave stopped to change his riding mechanic, who was badly injured by a piece of flying tire thread from another car.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":4},{"lap":23,"text":"Nazzaro retired on lap 23 with brake trouble","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":11},{"lap":24,"text":"Marchisio retires with engine trouble; Divo pits to change his riding mechanic.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":29,"text":"Segrave, sixth, laps in 11m19s at 122.71 km/h, a new lap record.","q":false,"c":4},{"lap":30,"text":"The order Ascari, Campari, Divo and Benoist remained up to the 30th lap, while Wagner and Segrave battled for fifth place.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":8},{"lap":33,"text":"On lap 33 Ascari slowed with engine trouble and Campari took the lead.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":34,"text":"On lap 34 Divo passed Ascari, who at Pont Rompu proceeded with a slow running engine.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":35,"text":"Ascari crawls to his pit; plugs and water do not help and the car will not restart.","q":false,"c":8},{"lap":35,"text":"Campari wins for Alfa Romeo.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":35,"text":"In the last laps Divo had made up some time and finished second just over one minute behind.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1}]}